flowchart LR
 A[Wave A: portable core, calculation, basic report] --> B[Wave B: intent, contract, literature, discovery]
 B --> C[Wave C: all ten categories, durable jobs, delivery]
 C --> D[Wave D: matched research trial and fault qualification]
 D --> G{All obligations proven?}
 G -->|Yes| R[Scoped M2a release]
 G -->|No| F[Fix failed obligation; retain evidence]
 F --> D
 P[Native JiuwenSwarm remains the agent platform] -.-> A & B & C
